    "media:imagetext": "Menu\nWelcome\nAboard!\nTUCSOI\nsCO\nLunch\nSAN FRANCISCO\n'49ers and guests\nSeafood Cocktail\nBroiled New York Steak Bordelaise\nButtered Peas\nAu Gratin Potatoes\nLuncheon Rolls\nChef's Salad Jardiniere\nChocolate Cake\nAssorted Cheese Tray\nTea\nAll of us at Pan American wish you the\nbest of luck in your bid for the championship\nthis season. As \"Goal Rushers\" and fans of\nlong standing, we'll be following every play.\nWe appreciate this opportunity to serve you\non your special charter flight — everything is\nbeing done to make it the most enjoyable ever.\nOnce again, welcome aboard and good luck!\nCoffee\nMixed Nuts\nMilk\nMint Wafers\nFruit Bowl\nPAN AMERICAN WORLD AIRWAYS",
